+# GT30Pro Mali-G615 TBR notes (Valhall 5, Tile-Based Rendering)
+- Keep depth/color in tile SRAM: prefer D24 over D32, depth storeOp=DONT_CARE when unread.
+- Merge color+resolve into one subpass; avoid MSAA and sample shading on Mali.
+- Turnip is Mesa/Linux-only: there is nothing to disable on Android Mali (closed ARM driver).
+- fa4e7c69 dropped the depth-comparison sampler fallback: if BOTW Link stays black,
+- force the shadow sampler to CompareOp LessOrEqual on D24, or use a "low shadows" game mod.
